## Increase visibility

Good Stuff has always been early to new marketing ideas. When some of the old playbook stopped pulling its weight, the team came to us to bring that same energy to social media.

## Join the GS crew

We built the feed on three content pillars: Facts of the South Bay, Meet the GS Family, and Something for Everyone. That mix turned owner Cris Bennett into a familiar local face and gave regulars a reason to share.

## The numbers back it up

We hit most of the milestones we set, and fast. More importantly, Good Stuff had the best summer in its 45 years, with a record number of guests through the door. Cris now gets recognized by people who know him from Instagram.
